WEBVTT

00:07.902 --> 00:13.662
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.162 --> 00:19.752
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
OCR'd and edited by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.752 --> 00:19.792
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.792 --> 00:28.342
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.342 --> 00:30.212
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.592 --> 00:34.142
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.472 --> 00:37.972
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.472 --> 00:40.812
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.812 --> 00:45.562
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.692 --> 00:48.902
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.862 --> 00:51.862
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.412 --> 01:01.122
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.452 --> 01:03.462
...with you.
futaride

01:04.462 --> 01:10.172
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.842 --> 01:16.262
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.472 --> 01:24.772
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.772 --> 01:26.602
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:34.192 --> 01:35.282
Shiratori-san,

01:37.032 --> 01:38.402
Miss Landlady?

01:38.452 --> 01:39.492
Um...

01:40.202 --> 01:41.912
This Sunday,

01:42.372 --> 01:43.282
would you...

01:44.542 --> 01:46.162
...go on a date with me?

01:46.622 --> 01:48.462
M-Miss Landlady...

01:53.382 --> 01:54.632
Um...

01:54.672 --> 01:55.672
If you'd like...

01:55.712 --> 01:57.922
What would I like?

01:58.302 --> 02:00.432
Eh, Shiratori!?

02:00.472 --> 02:01.262
Huh?

02:01.722 --> 02:03.512
Saki... chan?

02:06.102 --> 02:06.602
Damn, how could you?!

02:06.602 --> 02:09.012
Um, er, that is...
Damn, how could you?!

02:09.562 --> 02:12.152
What are you doing?!

02:12.192 --> 02:13.062
I'm sorry!

02:16.992 --> 02:17.612
Huh?

02:21.912 --> 02:23.532
It was just a dream.

02:23.582 --> 02:25.622
What a dream it was.

02:26.542 --> 02:28.502
Oh yeah,

02:29.252 --> 02:30.082
today...

02:33.482 --> 02:38.282
Shopping

02:46.892 --> 02:50.272
I'm going shopping with Miss Landlady.

02:50.312 --> 02:51.562
Hence the dream.

02:52.442 --> 02:54.062
This Sunday...

02:56.692 --> 02:58.192
What am I thinking?!

02:58.232 --> 03:02.162
I'm just a porter for her shopping today!

03:02.202 --> 03:05.372
You're brushing hard to get ready for a date.

03:06.532 --> 03:09.702
Having a good appearance is important for a date.

03:09.752 --> 03:11.292
What are you talking about?

03:11.332 --> 03:13.882
I'm just helping her shop today, and it's not a date.

03:13.922 --> 03:16.252
A man and a woman going out together.

03:16.292 --> 03:18.212
That's enough to be a date.

03:18.252 --> 03:20.512
Good luck, Shiratori-kun.

03:20.552 --> 03:22.632
D-D-Date?

03:23.382 --> 03:24.392
Date...

03:26.472 --> 03:28.182
All set.

03:28.222 --> 03:30.772
What is set?

03:32.272 --> 03:32.962
Tama-chan!

03:33.102 --> 03:37.362
I won't forgive you if you disturb Kozue-chan's happiness.

03:37.402 --> 03:38.652
I know.

03:39.532 --> 03:40.992
That's right.

03:41.032 --> 03:46.272
All we can do is watch them with love.

03:46.272 --> 03:48.792
You know well, Tama-chan

03:48.792 --> 03:49.792
Yes.

04:01.882 --> 04:05.262
Is this really a date?

04:05.302 --> 04:08.472
No, no, I'm just a porter today.

04:08.512 --> 04:10.392
But Momono-san said it's a date, too...

04:10.392 --> 04:10.932
Sorry to make you wait.
But Momono-san said it's a date, too...

04:10.932 --> 04:11.602
Sorry to make you wait.

04:12.682 --> 04:14.812
No, not at all.

04:20.322 --> 04:21.322
Shall we?

04:23.112 --> 04:23.822
Yeah.

04:29.082 --> 04:29.582
Oh?

04:30.242 --> 04:31.832
We're not going to the shopping district today?

04:31.872 --> 04:32.542
Nope.

04:33.372 --> 04:36.042
We've got to do some special shopping today,

04:36.082 --> 04:38.962
so I thought it'd be better to go to a department store with a wider selection.

04:41.342 --> 04:43.212
Special shopping...

04:43.262 --> 04:44.802
Since we're here,

04:45.552 --> 04:47.802
should we look around from the lower level up?

04:48.472 --> 04:49.932
Yeah, let's.

04:50.432 --> 04:52.642
Then let's start on the first floor.

04:52.682 --> 04:53.772
Yeah.

04:55.852 --> 04:57.522
Then shall we...

04:58.562 --> 04:59.442
...go too?

04:59.902 --> 05:02.612
Momo-san, remember...

05:02.652 --> 05:04.942
We'll just watch!

05:08.052 --> 05:10.262
Jewelry Fair

05:10.282 --> 05:11.952
Jewelry store, huh?

05:11.992 --> 05:13.912
Hi there, you two.

05:14.122 --> 05:16.662
How would you like paired rings for the memory of your love?

05:17.122 --> 05:18.632
P-Paired rings?

05:18.672 --> 05:21.632
With these, you'll always be together even when you're far apart.

05:22.502 --> 05:24.462
We'll engrave your names on them for free if you buy now.

05:24.512 --> 05:25.632
Oh, wait...

05:27.052 --> 05:28.842
You're so cute when you're embarrassed!

05:28.892 --> 05:31.392
Then I'll give you a special deal!

05:31.892 --> 05:34.852
But... well... um...

05:39.352 --> 05:41.112
They're so naive!

05:41.152 --> 05:43.072
Kozue-chan, you're so lovely!

05:43.482 --> 05:45.362
Come again!

05:45.402 --> 05:47.492
Buy something next time!

05:47.952 --> 05:50.202
S-She rushed to a conclusion.

05:52.332 --> 05:54.122
H-How about the next floor?

05:54.162 --> 05:55.252
Uhh, sure!

06:01.922 --> 06:02.842
Miss Landlady?

06:02.882 --> 06:05.922
I don't like escalators very much.

06:05.962 --> 06:08.722
It's hard to determine the timing of when to get on.

06:08.762 --> 06:09.802
Timing?

06:10.432 --> 06:11.682
That's so much like her!

06:11.722 --> 06:12.722
So lovely!

06:12.852 --> 06:15.202
Hats

06:21.942 --> 06:23.062
So nice!

06:23.112 --> 06:24.982
That's your favorite?

06:25.072 --> 06:27.472
Accessories

06:37.122 --> 06:39.162
See? It looks good on you!

06:39.332 --> 06:41.732
Glasses

06:42.082 --> 06:43.672
There are so many.

06:43.712 --> 06:44.422
Yeah.

06:47.262 --> 06:48.592
They look good on you!

06:49.762 --> 06:50.802
What's the matter?

06:50.842 --> 06:52.392
These sunglasses...

06:52.432 --> 06:53.512
...open up!

06:53.552 --> 06:55.432
There are those types too.

06:55.602 --> 06:57.982
Toys

06:59.062 --> 07:00.142
What's this?

07:00.442 --> 07:02.812
If you do this in front of it...

07:04.482 --> 07:06.232
Oh my...

07:08.112 --> 07:10.702
She seems to like it a lot.

07:11.912 --> 07:13.412
Shall we get going, Miss Landlady?

07:13.452 --> 07:14.702
Yes.

07:14.742 --> 07:17.582
I'm sorry, Shiratori-san, for making you wait.

07:17.622 --> 07:19.542
Not at all, Miss Landlady.

07:19.582 --> 07:20.832
It was fun for me, too.

07:21.832 --> 07:24.922
"Miss Landlady" and "Shiratori-san", huh?

07:24.962 --> 07:26.632
It's no different from usual.

07:26.672 --> 07:27.962
Should we get going?

07:28.002 --> 07:31.512
Well, well, let's watch them a bit longer.

07:33.342 --> 07:36.182
Shopping for the important thing is next.

07:36.222 --> 07:37.392
The important thing?

07:37.432 --> 07:41.022
It's finally my turn.

07:41.062 --> 07:44.442
Then I'll do my best at my duty as a porter!

07:45.732 --> 07:47.822
Shiratori-san, over here.

07:49.482 --> 07:50.822
Over here?

07:53.032 --> 07:54.112
A rice bowl?

07:54.662 --> 07:56.832
Yes, for you.

07:57.622 --> 07:58.582
For me?

07:58.622 --> 07:59.582
Yes.

07:59.992 --> 08:03.202
It will be the rice bowl you'll be using at Narutakisou.

08:03.832 --> 08:07.132
Until now you've been using the guest bowl.

08:07.132 --> 08:11.132
I always give one to any new resident.

08:11.552 --> 08:12.802
I see.

08:12.842 --> 08:17.932
They have a large selection, so I'm sure you can find something you like.

08:18.892 --> 08:23.772
Meals taste better when you eat with the plates and bowls you like.

08:25.152 --> 08:26.232
Miss Landlady...

08:27.192 --> 08:31.862
Oh, so you used the royalty ticket just for this?

08:31.902 --> 08:33.072
Well, yes.

08:33.112 --> 08:39.032
Since I'll be taking up your Sunday, I thought it might bother you.

08:39.032 --> 08:40.872
But since it's a rare chance.

08:41.542 --> 08:42.292
Um...

08:42.952 --> 08:45.412
So, which one would you like?

08:45.412 --> 08:46.332
That's it!

08:47.132 --> 08:50.842
Since we're here, would you pick one for me?

08:50.882 --> 08:52.712
Me?

08:52.712 --> 08:53.382
Yeah.

08:53.802 --> 08:58.392
I may like it better that way, since it's really a present from you.

08:58.892 --> 09:00.222
Can you do that for me?

09:01.262 --> 09:02.142
Ye... yes!

09:02.772 --> 09:05.142
Then let me pick one.

09:05.192 --> 09:06.442
I see.

09:06.812 --> 09:09.402
So this is her plan today.

09:09.442 --> 09:12.032
She gave one to us too.

09:12.072 --> 09:13.322
Yes.

09:13.362 --> 09:16.782
But then, she didn't have to use the royalty ticket either.

09:16.822 --> 09:18.662
It's so like her.

09:27.622 --> 09:32.052
It really feels like we're on a date.

09:32.052 --> 09:34.882
Maybe people might really think that we're dating.

09:34.922 --> 09:36.382
How about this?

09:39.472 --> 09:40.762
Syokupanda?

09:40.802 --> 09:41.472
Yes.

09:42.562 --> 09:45.602
I think... that's... cute...

09:46.432 --> 09:47.762
How is that good?

09:47.762 --> 09:49.102
So lovely!

09:49.772 --> 09:51.402
Thank you very much!

09:52.612 --> 09:54.232
Here you go, Shiratori-san.

09:55.112 --> 09:56.612
Thank you, Miss Landlady.

09:56.652 --> 09:58.782
I'll take good care of it.

09:58.822 --> 10:03.032
I must thank you for today, too.

10:03.082 --> 10:05.542
Oh, well, then shall we...

10:05.542 --> 10:06.252
Wait!
Oh, well, then shall we...

10:06.252 --> 10:06.792
Wait!

10:09.332 --> 10:10.212
Miss Landlady!

10:10.792 --> 10:12.462
Hey, wait!

10:14.252 --> 10:15.262
Hey!

10:16.422 --> 10:18.052
What was that?

10:20.222 --> 10:21.642
Miss Landlady, are you alrig...?

10:22.932 --> 10:24.102
D-Damn you!

10:24.432 --> 10:26.182
D-Damn?

10:27.062 --> 10:28.102
That word...

10:28.142 --> 10:29.102
...sounds familiar!

10:29.142 --> 10:31.102
How could you?!

10:31.652 --> 10:33.332
What are you doing?!

10:33.692 --> 10:35.322
I knew it, from this morning...

10:37.652 --> 10:39.822
Huh? Where am I?

10:40.452 --> 10:42.412
Why am I here?

10:42.452 --> 10:46.452
Oh my, of all the possible places, Saki-chan shows up here?!

10:46.492 --> 10:48.542
What a troublesome development.

10:48.582 --> 10:51.882
It's... deja vu...

11:14.812 --> 11:16.482
That was because those boys just rushed toward us, and...

11:16.482 --> 11:17.652
I could at least explain the situation.
That was because those boys just rushed toward us, and...

11:17.652 --> 11:19.322
I could at least explain the situation.

11:19.362 --> 11:23.362
But why Saki-chan?

11:23.412 --> 11:25.372
I could at least handle Nanako-chan.

11:26.032 --> 11:28.702
Oh, it's over already?

11:29.202 --> 11:31.832
Is it broken?

11:31.872 --> 11:33.792
You broke it.

11:33.832 --> 11:36.212
Hey, Shiratori, let's go to the next one.

11:36.712 --> 11:38.422
The next one!

11:38.462 --> 11:39.922
Um, Saki-chan...

11:39.922 --> 11:40.422
Shut up!
Um, Saki-chan...

11:40.422 --> 11:41.012
Shut up!

11:41.052 --> 11:41.762
Hurry up!

11:41.802 --> 11:44.302
Shiratori-kun looks good this way.

11:44.342 --> 11:46.472
It's more fun watching this.

11:46.512 --> 11:48.932
All right, let's play this next!

11:48.972 --> 11:49.082
This?

11:49.082 --> 11:50.352
The Hell High School
This?

11:50.352 --> 11:50.392
The Hell High School

11:50.392 --> 11:52.082
I've never played these games.
The Hell High School

11:52.082 --> 11:52.312
I've never played these games.

11:52.352 --> 11:54.652
You just need to hit the buttons at random.

11:55.232 --> 11:56.442
Ready?

11:56.982 --> 11:58.692
All right, I'll pick... him

11:58.692 --> 11:59.942
Ultimate Gang Head Riki
All right, I'll pick... him

11:59.942 --> 12:00.032
Ultimate Gang Head Riki

12:00.442 --> 12:01.992
Then I'll pick him.

12:02.132 --> 12:03.532
Mad Science Teacher Kyou

12:07.372 --> 12:09.242
OK, here I come!

12:09.792 --> 12:11.162
There! What's the matter?

12:11.202 --> 12:13.332
But I don't know what to do.

12:13.372 --> 12:16.252
You just push the buttons at random.

12:16.962 --> 12:19.302
But still...

12:19.342 --> 12:21.762
Saki-chan is strong as usual.

12:22.302 --> 12:24.472
She loves that stuff.

12:24.512 --> 12:27.512
We've been victimized numerous times in the past, too.

12:27.552 --> 12:29.812
Look you have no life left.

12:30.392 --> 12:31.892
I don't care, then!

12:34.442 --> 12:36.232
The Super Science Beam!

12:36.232 --> 12:37.482
What the?
The Super Science Beam!

12:37.482 --> 12:37.522
The Super Science Beam!

12:39.382 --> 12:40.132
You win.

12:42.612 --> 12:43.492
I won...

12:43.532 --> 12:44.112
Shut up!

12:44.112 --> 12:44.282
Round 2.
Shut up!

12:44.282 --> 12:44.322
Round 2.

12:44.322 --> 12:44.932
Next!
Round 2.

12:44.932 --> 12:45.532
Next!

12:45.532 --> 12:46.322
Fight!

12:46.572 --> 12:50.492
The Super Cosmo Attack!

12:51.702 --> 12:52.902
You lose!

12:53.912 --> 12:55.752
I won on my first play.

12:55.752 --> 12:57.192
This is pretty fun.

12:57.192 --> 12:59.752
SHIRATORI!

12:59.792 --> 13:02.132
Play again!

13:02.172 --> 13:03.632
Y-Yes.

13:04.762 --> 13:06.012
The science teacher wins!

13:06.052 --> 13:07.432
One more time!

13:08.302 --> 13:09.512
You don't have enough science.

13:09.512 --> 13:10.312
Not done yet!
You don't have enough science.

13:10.312 --> 13:11.062
Not done yet!

13:11.852 --> 13:14.312
You should restart at being a reptile.

13:16.522 --> 13:18.062
Um, Saki-chan?

13:18.102 --> 13:18.902
Shut up!

13:18.942 --> 13:20.692
One more time!

13:21.192 --> 13:22.902
Shiratori-kun is really...

13:22.942 --> 13:24.902
...slow to notice.

13:30.372 --> 13:33.042
That's what you get when I get serious.

13:33.372 --> 13:35.912
I didn't expect to play until she won.

13:35.962 --> 13:37.042
Hey, Shiratori.

13:38.122 --> 13:39.922
Don't feel bad.

13:39.962 --> 13:42.072
You just played against a much badder partner.

13:44.342 --> 13:45.052
Anything wrong?

13:45.092 --> 13:46.512
No.

13:46.552 --> 13:47.972
Oh well.

13:48.012 --> 13:49.932
Give it back!

13:50.802 --> 13:52.812
No way.

13:54.932 --> 13:56.982
Give it back...

13:57.732 --> 13:58.902
He's...

14:00.192 --> 14:01.402
...I think...

14:01.442 --> 14:02.652
...from back then!

14:04.902 --> 14:06.402
Oh? Saki-chan?

14:06.442 --> 14:08.952
Here, what's the matter?

14:10.242 --> 14:11.202
S-Saki-chan!

14:12.242 --> 14:14.042
A grown-up is bullying us!

14:14.082 --> 14:16.372
You're bad!

14:23.342 --> 14:23.802
Ouch...

14:23.842 --> 14:25.512
Hey!

14:25.552 --> 14:30.012
Aren't you guys ashamed of picking on one guy?!

14:31.092 --> 14:32.352
Saki-chan...

14:33.472 --> 14:34.222
Shut up!

14:34.222 --> 14:34.812
Damn!
Shut up!

14:34.852 --> 14:36.182
We'll get you back!

14:37.522 --> 14:39.022
Total wimps.

14:39.562 --> 14:40.602
Onee-chan!

14:42.652 --> 14:45.232
Um, thank...

14:47.152 --> 14:48.782
What are you doing, Saki-chan?!

14:48.782 --> 14:49.202
Shut up!
What are you doing, Saki-chan?!

14:49.202 --> 14:49.572
Shut up!

14:49.612 --> 14:53.202
I hate both the person who picks on others and the person who gets picked on!

14:53.242 --> 14:54.622
No way!

14:55.872 --> 14:57.502
Here, have some plum ice cream.

14:57.542 --> 14:59.122
Thank you.

14:59.912 --> 15:01.082
Do you feel settled?

15:01.122 --> 15:01.792
Yes.

15:03.332 --> 15:04.882
Sour!

15:05.422 --> 15:08.052
Plum ice cream is the best.

15:08.092 --> 15:09.632
Saki-chan...

15:09.672 --> 15:10.882
Hey, kid,

15:11.762 --> 15:15.562
have you ever thought about why you get picked on?

15:16.772 --> 15:19.182
It's because you're weak.

15:20.442 --> 15:24.482
If you don't want to get picked on, then be strong!

15:24.522 --> 15:26.192
But how?

15:26.192 --> 15:26.572
It's easy.
But how?

15:26.572 --> 15:28.822
It's easy.

15:28.862 --> 15:30.952
You get them before they get you.

15:30.992 --> 15:33.362
Punch them before they punch you.

15:33.412 --> 15:35.582
Kick them before they kick you.

15:36.412 --> 15:39.182
In other words, have that strength of mind.

15:39.412 --> 15:42.332
If you think strong, your punches and kicks will get stronger too.

15:42.712 --> 15:44.712
The mindset of being strong.

15:44.752 --> 15:47.052
The mindset that says "I'll never be weak!"

15:47.712 --> 15:51.022
You were losing right there.

15:53.932 --> 15:54.722
Can I...

15:56.142 --> 15:57.722
...become strong?

16:01.022 --> 16:01.772
Of course!

16:03.022 --> 16:04.702
Show 'em what you've got!

16:05.942 --> 16:06.732
Yeah!

16:06.772 --> 16:09.232
Yeah, that's the spirit!

16:09.282 --> 16:11.692
Remember the guts!

16:11.692 --> 16:12.362
Yeah!
Remember the guts!

16:17.782 --> 16:20.702
Thank you, Onee-chan, Onii-chan!

16:20.752 --> 16:22.502
Remember the guts!

16:22.542 --> 16:23.462
Yeah!

16:26.752 --> 16:28.462
Saki-chan,

16:28.922 --> 16:32.172
I could only see the tomboyish side of you until now,

16:32.922 --> 16:33.632
but...

16:35.012 --> 16:35.972
You're kind.

16:39.642 --> 16:41.102
What are you saying?!

16:41.142 --> 16:42.432
I'm not!

16:42.482 --> 16:44.522
You don't have to be embarrassed.

16:44.562 --> 16:46.312
I'm not embarrassed.

16:50.402 --> 16:51.752
W-What's wrong?

16:51.842 --> 16:53.402
B-B-B-Butterfly...

16:53.742 --> 16:55.572
Yeah, it is.

16:55.612 --> 16:58.702
I hate those things!

17:00.412 --> 17:03.752
You also have something you don't like, Saki-chan.

17:03.792 --> 17:05.872
D-Don't tell that to anyone!

17:05.922 --> 17:09.842
If anyone finds that out...

17:12.302 --> 17:13.722
S-Saki-chan!

17:16.052 --> 17:17.972
My, oh my...

17:19.682 --> 17:20.542
Saki-chan!

17:20.792 --> 17:21.932
Saki-chan!

17:26.022 --> 17:26.942
Are you okay?

17:28.232 --> 17:29.862
Shiratori-san?

17:30.772 --> 17:32.442
Where are we?

17:32.482 --> 17:34.492
Um, Miss Landlady?

17:34.532 --> 17:35.492
Yes.

17:36.862 --> 17:38.322
Um, Shiratori-san,

17:38.362 --> 17:39.782
Y-Yes?

17:39.822 --> 17:41.792
why am I here?

17:41.832 --> 17:43.662
W-Well, that's...

17:48.962 --> 17:50.042
Um...

17:50.882 --> 17:53.422
I know you have many questions,

17:54.092 --> 17:55.092
but for now...

17:56.552 --> 17:57.382
...should we go home?

18:00.722 --> 18:01.102
Yes.

18:06.232 --> 18:08.852
After all that, there was nothing gained today.

18:09.152 --> 18:11.562
I gained a lot today!

18:11.612 --> 18:13.652
I got these of Kozue-chan, and these of Saki-chan, and...

18:13.652 --> 18:14.232
Not like that!
I got these of Kozue-chan, and these of Saki-chan, and...

18:14.232 --> 18:15.692
Not like that!

18:15.742 --> 18:20.662
Since they got together, they should have done this, and that...

18:20.702 --> 18:22.332
Well, well, Momo-san,

18:22.372 --> 18:25.372
quit mumbling stupid things, and let's go home.

18:26.002 --> 18:29.542
Anyway, I can't stand not having done anything!

18:29.582 --> 18:31.382
Yeah, yeah.

18:32.632 --> 18:34.592
We're home.

18:36.012 --> 18:37.882
Welcome home.

18:37.922 --> 18:38.382
Oh?

18:39.052 --> 18:41.852
You went out together today?

18:41.892 --> 18:42.712
Yes, we did.

18:42.712 --> 18:44.402
But what can I gain?
Yes, we did.

18:44.402 --> 18:45.752
But what can I gain?

18:46.892 --> 18:49.522
By the way, what are you all doing?

18:49.562 --> 18:52.272
I thought we'd eat dinner together.

18:52.312 --> 18:54.522
So Onii-chan and I are helping.

18:55.652 --> 18:57.572
That's a good idea.

18:57.612 --> 18:59.862
Oh? That rice bowl...

18:59.902 --> 19:03.202
Today, Miss Landlady bought that...

19:03.832 --> 19:04.582
I see!

19:04.622 --> 19:07.322
That's why you went out shopping with Kozue Onee-chan today!

19:07.322 --> 19:08.122
Miss Landlady...
That's why you went out shopping with Kozue Onee-chan today!

19:08.122 --> 19:08.992
She gave me one before too!
Miss Landlady...

19:08.992 --> 19:10.252
Kozue Onee-chan...
She gave me one before too!

19:10.252 --> 19:10.952
Kozue Onee-chan...

19:12.672 --> 19:15.592
But she spent the royalty ticket for that...

19:15.632 --> 19:16.342
Yep.

19:16.382 --> 19:17.962
But I'm planning on giving it back to her.

19:18.512 --> 19:22.012
She should use it for herself.

19:24.432 --> 19:25.102
Then...

19:26.012 --> 19:28.562
Kozue-chan, can I have this?

19:29.182 --> 19:30.772
Yes, go ahead.

19:30.812 --> 19:32.232
That easily?!

19:34.692 --> 19:37.822
Now, what shall I do?

19:39.942 --> 19:43.452
Okay, then, from now on, Shiratori-kun...

19:44.122 --> 19:46.872
...you're prohibited to call Kozue-chan "Miss Landlady."

19:48.162 --> 19:52.082
I've thought about this before, but why "Miss Landlady?"

19:52.122 --> 19:54.252
It's rude to her.

19:54.792 --> 19:58.512
She has a cute name, it's "Kozue."

19:59.012 --> 20:03.262
You promised right... so, correct yourself!

20:03.302 --> 20:04.082
Now, now!

20:04.342 --> 20:05.682
But...

20:05.722 --> 20:07.392
...calling her by her name so suddenly...

20:07.432 --> 20:09.932
...that would be really rude!

20:09.972 --> 20:10.522
Maybe...

20:11.022 --> 20:12.232
Really?

20:12.272 --> 20:13.732
Kozue-chan, is it rude?

20:13.772 --> 20:15.902
No, nut really.

20:16.732 --> 20:17.862
See?

20:17.902 --> 20:19.692
Give it up.

20:22.952 --> 20:23.742
Um...

20:23.782 --> 20:24.702
Yes...

20:25.662 --> 20:26.452
Ko...

20:27.032 --> 20:27.662
Ko...

20:28.032 --> 20:28.832
Ko...

20:31.792 --> 20:32.832
Kozue-chan.

20:34.752 --> 20:35.332
Yes!

20:36.922 --> 20:39.882
That's a big step!

20:39.922 --> 20:41.512
That made this Sunday meaningful!

20:42.132 --> 20:44.712
Now, Kozue-chan, let's have dinner.

20:44.712 --> 20:47.802
I'll go get Mom and Haibara-san.

20:53.642 --> 20:55.062
Good morning, Onii-chan.

20:55.102 --> 20:56.352
Good morning.

20:56.402 --> 20:57.982
You're going to school now, too?

20:58.442 --> 20:59.192
Yep!

21:01.862 --> 21:03.242
Good morning, Onee-chan.

21:03.782 --> 21:04.992
Good morning.

21:05.662 --> 21:07.162
Good morning, Miss L...

21:07.202 --> 21:08.452
I mean...

21:09.742 --> 21:10.622
Kozue-chan.

21:12.302 --> 21:12.922
Yes!

21:13.372 --> 21:14.712
Good morning!

21:18.672 --> 21:20.462
It's just...

21:20.502 --> 21:21.922
What's the matter?

21:23.132 --> 21:26.342
Well, I told him that yesterday,

21:26.382 --> 21:29.892
but seeing them being so close makes me feel funny.

21:29.932 --> 21:32.432
Momo-san, you're so irresponsible.

21:33.642 --> 21:35.642
Onii-chan, we need to get going!

21:35.692 --> 21:37.262
Oh, yeah!

21:37.262 --> 21:40.322
Well, Kozue-chan, see you later!

21:40.322 --> 21:41.442
See you later!

21:41.482 --> 21:42.442
Have a nice day!

21:51.372 --> 21:57.882
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

21:57.962 --> 22:03.682
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:05.102 --> 22:11.562
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:11.812 --> 22:16.862
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:18.822 --> 22:25.572
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:25.822 --> 22:31.502
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:32.502 --> 22:38.342
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:38.342 --> 22:40.592
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:40.802 --> 22:46.972
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:47.472 --> 22:53.312
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

22:53.312 --> 22:57.942
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

